    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1999_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1999_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been tampering with the locks again. You just won't give up, will you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unfortunately, the area that the search parties are looking is at least five kilometers from here. Don't expect them to hear your distress signal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_255_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1999_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_plasticbag",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1999_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "At least eat something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Malnutrition during the recovery process will increase the time needed for bones to mend by twenty percent, and the chance of complications by thirty-five percent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not my intention to hurt you, or leave an outstanding warrior with a permanent disability.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_255_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cut the crap!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_255_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I warn you, you'd better kill me now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1999_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I suppose that's an option...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "text": "As I said, however, I have no intention of bringing harm to Kjerag, and I certainly feel no need to take innocent Kjerag lives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, it was a miracle that we survived that avalanche at all...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1999_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was, in your people's words, 'Kjeragandr's protection'. Right?",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shouldn't that be a sign to a faithful follower of Kjeragandr to value her own life?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_255_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "No intention of bringing harm to Kjerag? You've been spying for the Victorians and stealing Kjerag's military secrets!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1999_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such an unfair accusation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1999_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you really think a few battleships constitute Kjerag's most important secret?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "text": "You speak of your god's blessings all the time, but have you really thought about what your god is?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_255_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you talking about... Kjeragandr is not to be questioned or doubted\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1999_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That didn't resonate? Well... I guess the only reason I'm talking to you about this is because there's nothing to do here to pass the time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1999_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah well, doesn't matter anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_255_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you want to pass the time, I've got something to ask you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "text": "How did a Victorian spy work for Rhine Lab for so long?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1999_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you so sure that I'm a Victorian spy, when I've been working at Rhine Lab for so long?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1999_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well... if you really want to hear it, I could tell you a little story\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "text": "There was once a girl in Victoria, who was incredibly fascinated to know how everything worked, and she wanted to spend her whole life studying.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1999_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A dozen years later, she went to Columbia as visiting scholar from the Royal Victorian Academy of Sciences...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was not the research foundations of Victoria that found her, but an intelligence agency.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "text": "From that day forth, the only thing she was allowed to be curious about was the secret documents of the Columbian government.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "text": "But her curiosity was not so easily stated. As she dug through Columbia's secrets, she found an opportunity to satisfy the very depths of her curiosity...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_255_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1999_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "At the end of the day, though, there is little that separates Columbia and Victoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "text": "People fight over the slightest morsel of profit, the order that took so much hard work to build is now teetering on the brink of ruinous war...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1999_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who has the time to gaze up at the heavens... or even down at the ground we stand on, of which we know so little about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I find it all a tedious bore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carolin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
