    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Early morning, Hall of Writings, Vine-Bead Court."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cloakmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good thing the window isn't too high.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The clerics have gone to their morning prayers... the observation station is a sensitive topic right now. I need to avoid them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maps, geographical records... anything that can help...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The morning sun shines through the window, and falls gently on the aged books."
    },
    {
        "text": "Elena dusts off the books in front of her, but finds the writing of the clerics difficult to decipher. She begins to regret not bringing a dictionary of the Kjeragi language."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do they categorize this stuff? This one's... a collection of quotes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Kjeragandr, showed Herself, to me, and said\u2014'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Seek not my temple, but my heart.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoa\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_manybooksdrop",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Elena lets go in panic, and the heavy book hits the floor."
    },
    {
        "text": "Through the bookshelves, she sees a surprised face under a hood, and a crossbow pointed at her face."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#8$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#6$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think she's surrendering, Enya. What do we do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's saying anything about surrendering?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait a moment... Enya? Enya Silverash?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y-You're the Saintess?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shh\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Elena nods in realization."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep quiet, and we can talk. Alright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Elena nods carefully."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Put away your crossbow, Joanna. Let's not scare our friend here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But she sneaked into the Vine-Bead Court. Doesn't seem like something a good person would do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, we sneaked in too...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your attire... are you from Rhine Lab?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes! I'm Elena, a researcher in the Energy Section.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry. I was just looking for a map of Kjerag, preferably recording the locations of mountains and Originium veins...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I find that special vein, maybe I could\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You could what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Elena glances at the young woman before her, who looks about the same age as her, while being the undisputed sovereign of this country."
    },
    {
        "text": "Elena is unsure if what she is about to say might offend her, but when she sees the pure curiosity on her face..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe... I can explain how this Catastrophe happened!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "24_g3_mainhall",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
        "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean that Kjerag has been safe from Catastrophe for a thousand years because of a hidden Originium vein?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes! There is an undiscovered Originium vein in the mountains surrounding Kjerag, which created an energy field that prevented Catastrophes from forming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Impossible! It's Kjeragandr that protects Kjerag!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Has anyone ever seen Kjeragandr with their own eyes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "text": "Many people have witnessed the miracles of Kjeragandr with their own eyes!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I respect your culture and traditions, but that doesn't prove anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just because you see something that can't be explained right now doesn't prove the existence of some supernatural being behind it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And how do you prove the veins have anything to do with it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The interactions between Originium is extremely complex, and what we know is only the tip of the iceberg.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhine Lab has conducted a number of experiments in recent years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "Under certain conditions, Originium can form energy fields that cause atmospheric Originium particles to disperse rather than converge, preventing the formation of Catastrophes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is something that we have not yet been able to recreate under controlled conditions...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if an Originium vein with the right conditions exists... then preventing Catastrophe may be a real possibility.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've made detailed calculations\u2014",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Excuse me, can I borrow this map?",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_sketchdraw",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Elena takes out her notebook and show it to the other two. She goes on a long explanation about the formulas as she draws on the page, not paying attention to whether her listeners are able to keep up."
    },
    {
        "text": "Finally, Elena confidently draws a circle at a location in the foothills on the map."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Therefore, the Originium Vein Theory is the most likely explanation for Kjerag's lack of Catastrophes!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm quite sure that my calculations are accurate, and if we find an Originium vein at this location, it would explain everything!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Joanna is in a daze. She glances at Enya, hoping the Saintess will rebuke this blasphemy."
    },
    {
        "text": "But the Saintess is quiet, biting her lower lip lightly."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whispers) Say something! I don't know what the hell she's writing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you explain the recent Catastrophe, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Based on the data, I suspect something from beyond the Starpod fell on Mount Karlan the day before the Catastrophe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look! These are the data that the station observed the day before the Catastrophe. These are infrasound waves created by the impact of the extraterrestrial object.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Elena turns on her portable terminal, displaying a sharp break on the line graph."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_devicebeep"
    },
    {
