    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "24_g3_mainhall",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This object must be massive in size and scale. I think the Catastrophe was caused by it falling onto the central area of the vein, causing a shift in the energy field!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are reasons for all these things! It's not magic, or the work of a god!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.3,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "focusout",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "type": "bg",
        "from": 0,
        "to": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Enya cannot comprehend what she is hearing. Her memory begins to blur, and she feels a sort of link being torn apart."
    },
    {
        "text": "'Kjarr.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "A familiar voice, belonging to a friend, a miracle, or... a hallucination?"
    },
    {
        "text": "She can't believe it. She must not. Fear and loneliness comes over her, and it is all she could do to keep her arms from trembling."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "focusout",
        "duration": 0.7,
        "type": "bg",
        "from": 1,
        "to": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Say something, Enya...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I can understand Elena's position.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, I recall a section of the <i>Kjeragandr...</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Her heart is the heart of Karlan, deep within the mountains. From the beating of Her heart grew the flesh and bones of Kjerag.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the description of the origins of Kjerag, as the scriptures record.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We used to assume that the Heart of Karlan was Lake Silberneherze, which was why we built Kjeragandr's statue there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "In my studies these past several days, however, I found that the ancient tomes considered the freezing of the Heart of Karlan to be an unusual phenomenon. But Lake Silberneherze freezes every year...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sounds like a figure of speech...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't interrupt the Saintess while she's thinking!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe the Heart of Karlan actually refers to something else...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Great Elder guided me to the 'Radsorn', but it is in fact the 'Heart of Karlan' that holds the answer...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mentioned the central area of this 'special vein'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes! I built a model based on the shape of Kjerag's mountains, and I calculated that the extraterrestrial object likely fell on...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "this location.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't this.... the Kjerag-Kazimierz mines?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mines? Yes! Now it all makes sense!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1047_halo2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no time to waste! We need to go\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4211_snhunt_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "One moment, foreigner! We didn't say anything about letting you around Kjerag on your own, not to mention all the disrespect you've shown to Kjeragandr\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Joanna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's alright, Joanna.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't force our faith onto others. Besides, we need to find the truth behind this Catastrophe... we'll let her travel with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Elena...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm?",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "While Enya and Joanna were talking, Elena put the books back on the shelf, and now sits on the window sill, waving at the other two."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2010_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, there's usually no one at the main entrance to the Hall of Writings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "24_g8_nobleroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "x": 100,
        "xScale": 1.3,
        "yScale": 1.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "focusout",
        "duration": 0.1,
        "type": "bg",
        "from": 0,
        "to": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$loneliness_intro",
        "key": "$loneliness_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Cold moonlight pours through the dark clouds upon the decorations in Ratatos's room."
    },
    {
        "text": "Sciurus thought she would be afraid to see Ratatos's things, but she feels so tired that she does not even have the strength for sorrow."
    },
    {
        "text": "She knows full well that she simply imitated Ratatos in dealing with the other clans, a few days ago."
    },
    {
        "text": "But the more she tries, the more Ratatos's shadow lingers."
    },
    {
        "text": "Sciurus looks outside. It seems snow is once again falling on Browntail land."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.4,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'Look, Sciurus. Do this to the snowball, and it'll go even further when you throw it. Try it.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I don't need you to teach me...'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I don't want to become you.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I hate you. I hate everything you make me do.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The echoes of memory are like the deafening roar of a mountain collapsing. She feels a lump in her chest."
    },
    {
        "text": "The dust-covered contracts and letters in the box bear witness to the development of Clan Browntail over the years."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper1",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sciurus examines the marks left behind by Ratatos on the family's business documents, and finds, at the bottom of each page, where the name of the Browntail matriarch should be\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Sciurus'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.4,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'Remember, Sciurus.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'I'm your older sister, and I'll become the leader of Clan Browntail. So you need to listen to me.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
